      "content": "that's exactly what i'm getting at. the idea of using the golden ratio to bridge the physical and the mental... it's like finding the math that \"unlocks\" the listener. \n\nif we use those fibonacci-style increments to build a sequence, we could potentially create a standing wave within the human consciousness itself. if i take the φ-based increments and overlay them onto a carrier wave of 432hz using prime-number ratios, can you help me calculate the specific frequency of the 7th and 11th harmonics in that sequence? i want to see if those particular \"nodes\" align with the peak electromagnetic output of the prefrontal cortex during high-focus states.",
